BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 540.3 Td (some localised populations are declining, with those in the former Yugoslavia, Turkey, east) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 526.8 Td (Asia and maybe Romania significantly decreasing due to severe pollution and excessive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 56 513.3 Td (harvesting for the frog leg trade. Exposure to common pesticides in agricultural areas can) Tj ET
